---
import { getEntry, render } from 'astro:content'
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

const page = (await getEntry('pages', 'academics'))!
const { Content } = await render(page)
---

<Base title="Academic work" description="Armağan Amcalar's research on P300-based brain-computer interfaces at Sabancı University, and later publications.">
  <article>
    <header class="post-head narrow">
      <span class="meta">Research · Sabancı University, 2007–2010</span>
      <h1>{page.data.title}</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="prose narrow">
      <Content />
      <h2>Later research</h2>
      <p>
        Fifteen years after my last academic paper, I returned to research with <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.15959">BRAID</a>, a paper on bounded
        reasoning for AI agents, written with Dr. Eyüp Çınar and published with OpenServ Labs in December 2025.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
